---
import BaseLayout from "../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/layout/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — GLP Index"
  description="GLP Index does not collect, store, or transmit your health data. All calculator inputs stay in your browser."
>
  <Header />

  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="crumbs">
        <a href="/">GLP Index</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="now">Privacy</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="serif" style="font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,60px);max-width:20ch">
        Your weight isn't sent anywhere — <em>not even to us.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:18px;font-size:18px;max-width:58ch">
        The short version of our privacy story, in language that means what it says. The longer legal version is below, side&#8209;by&#8209;side with the plain&#8209;English one.
      </p>
      <p style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#6B655C;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:14px">
        Last updated · May 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap">
    <!-- Three promises -->
    <div class="promises">
      <div class="promise">
        <div class="promise-num">Promise 01</div>
        <h3 class="serif">We <em>can't</em> see what you typed.</h3>
        <p>Every calculator runs entirely inside your browser tab. There's no server receiving your inputs. There's no database of user health records — because there's no database.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="promise">
        <div class="promise-num">Promise 02</div>
        <h3 class="serif">No accounts. No cookies. No tracking.</h3>
        <p>We don't run advertising pixels, fingerprinting, or retargeting. No Google Ads. No Meta Pixel. No TikTok Pixel. The site has nothing to sell you that needs to follow you around.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="promise">
        <div class="promise-num">Promise 03</div>
        <h3 class="serif">We <em>genuinely</em> don't make money from your data.</h3>
        <p>If we ever add affiliate links to a telehealth provider, they'll be clearly labelled — and they'll never be inside a calculator or a tracking pixel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Detail sections -->
    <section class="detail">
      <div class="detail-head">
        <div class="detail-num">01</div>
        <h2 class="serif">What you type into a calculator.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-body">
        <div class="split">
          <div class="split-col plain">
            <div class="split-label">In plain English</div>
            <p>Your weight, goal, and medication get math'd against the trial data right there on your phone. They go nowhere. You can refresh the page and they're gone — even from us.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="split-col legal">
            <div class="split-label">Legal version</div>
            <p>Inputs to the calculators are processed entirely client-side using JavaScript. They are never transmitted to our servers or any third party. We do not have servers that receive or store health information; we do not have a user account system; we do not have a database of health records.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>The only data persisted in your browser is a single preference flag (whether you've dismissed the medical disclaimer banner). It contains no health information.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail">
      <div class="detail-head">
        <div class="detail-num">02</div>
        <h2 class="serif">How we count visitors.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-body">
        <p>We use <strong>Plausible Analytics</strong> to know how many people visit and which pages are popular. Plausible is a European, privacy-preserving service that:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Doesn't use cookies</li>
          <li>Doesn't collect or store personal data</li>
          <li>Doesn't fingerprint or track across sites</li>
          <li>Is GDPR / CCPA / PECR compliant without a cookie banner</li>
          <li>Doesn't send anything to Google, Meta, or any ad network</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The data Plausible collects (aggregate page views, referrer source, approximate country) is not linked to individuals and cannot identify you.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail">
      <div class="detail-head">
        <div class="detail-num">03</div>
        <h2 class="serif">Advertising and affiliates.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-body">
        <p>GLP Index does not run advertising networks, advertising trackers, or retargeting pixels. We do not use Google Ads, Meta Pixel, TikTok Pixel, or any similar service.</p>
        <p>GLP Index does not currently have affiliate partnerships. If we add affiliate links in the future, they will be clearly disclosed — and they will not involve third-party tracking code running on our pages.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail">
      <div class="detail-head">
        <div class="detail-num">04</div>
        <h2 class="serif">Links that leave the site.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-body">
        <p>Links to clinical-trial papers (NEJM, Lancet) and pharmacy / pricing sources take you to third-party websites. Once you leave GLP Index, those sites' own privacy policies apply. We encourage you to review them before providing any personal information.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail">
      <div class="detail-head">
        <div class="detail-num">05</div>
        <h2 class="serif">Hosting.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-body">
        <p>GLP Index is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may collect server-side logs (IP addresses, request timestamps) as part of standard web infrastructure operation. These logs are governed by Cloudflare's privacy policy.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="detail">
      <div class="detail-head">
        <div class="detail-num">06</div>
        <h2 class="serif">Questions.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-body">
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@glpdash.com">hello@glpdash.com</a>. We read every message and reply within a few days.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-head {
    padding: 64px 0 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E0DAD0;
  }

  /* Promises grid */
  .promises {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: #E0DAD0;
    border: 1px solid #E0DAD0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 48px 0;
  }

  .promise {
    background: #FBFAF7;
    padding: 32px 28px;
  }

  .promise-num {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #3F5D52;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .promise h3 {
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .promise h3 em { font-style: italic; color: #3F5D52; }

  .promise p { font-size: 14px; color: #3A352E; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* Detail sections */
  .detail {
    padding: 48px 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
    border-top: 1px solid #E0DAD0;
  }

  .detail-head h2 {
    font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .detail-num {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #6B655C;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .detail-body { max-width: 62ch; }

  .detail-body p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #3A352E;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .detail-body p strong { color: #1A1815; font-weight: 600; }

  .detail-body ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .detail-body li {
    position: relative;
    padding: 6px 0 6px 22px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #3A352E;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .detail-body li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 14px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 1px;
    background: #3F5D52;
  }

  .detail-body a {
    color: #3F5D52;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #3F5D52 30%, transparent);
  }

  /* Plain/legal split */
  .split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 24px 0;
    background: #FBFAF7;
    border: 1px solid #E0DAD0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .split-col { padding: 20px 24px; }

  .split-col + .split-col { border-left: 1px solid #E0DAD0; }

  .split-label {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6B655C;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .plain .split-label { color: #3F5D52; }

  .split-col p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    color: #3A352E;
  }

  .plain p {
    color: #1A1815;
    font-family: "Fraunces", serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 880px) {
    .promises { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .detail { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .split-col + .split-col { border-left: none; border-top: 1px solid #E0DAD0; }
  }
</style>
